        {
          "book": "2CO",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "For according to their power, I testify, yes and beyond their power, they gave of their own accord,",
      "ko": "내가 증거하노니 저희가 힘대로 할 뿐아니라 힘에 지나도록 자원하여",
      "source_text_hash": "56c39c076c2122886cd59ba281e944b9abfcd7a76c92da6fe84e1fb14c7d4922",
      "translation_text_hash": "a679214fb774a8a1c7dd447342d944b40321244b3a2e03d5774020aa63fbd630",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내가 증거하노니 저희가 힘대로 할 뿐아니라 힘에 지나도록 자원하여"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "a679214fb774a8a1c7dd447342d944b40321244b3a2e03d5774020aa63fbd630"
      ]
    },
    {
