      "en": "As it is written, “He who gathered much had nothing left over, and he who gathered little had no lack.”",
      "ko": "기록한것 같이 많이 거둔 자도 남지 아니하였고 적게 거둔 자도 모자라지 아니하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "7f4a79764cfb48d2a44a15cf33e84bb5b4aaeb1b880fc6a03c976fd435fe03dc",
      "translation_text_hash": "6fa97d7f6db99c1f5ebfddae3bf2b21924a631e63ab39d015f75f26e8f9d8255",
